Subject: [PATCH] Update ELFIO symbol hash lookup

Backport the SysV and GNU symbol lookup updates to ELFIO 3.12: bounds-
checked, endian-aware and alignment-safe hash table reads, bounded chain
traversal, authoritative misses on well-formed tables (local and unhashed
symbols are still searched linearly), output parameters written only on a
match, and alignment-safe symbol record access.

Upstream: https://github.com/serge1/ELFIO/pull/174
JIRA: SWSPLAT-24296

Remove this backport when updating to a release that includes these changes.

